msgstr ""

msgid "Brand, layout, header, footer, blog, shop and advanced options."
msgstr ""

msgid "The Customizer groups site-wide colors and typography, layout, header/footer, blog, WooCommerce and advanced settings. Theme Options exposes selected settings without live preview."
